                ))}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="chart-note">Every bar is one hover from its date and sweep stamp in production. Each chart carries a text equivalent for screen readers, and rule and direction are named in words, never carried by color alone.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

